{
    "background_story": "Neil was a thrill-seeking college student who loved exploring the paranormal. One fateful night, he gathered his friends in the dorm's common room to try out a Ouija board. As they placed their fingers on the planchette, Neil felt an eerie excitement. The board began to move on its own, spelling out messages that sent shivers down their spines. But as the night wore on, Neil became increasingly obsessed with the board, convinced that it held the key to communicating with the other side. His friends grew uneasy, but Neil couldn't resist the temptation to delve deeper into the mysteries of the Ouija. As the sessions continued, strange occurrences began to plague Neil's life, and his friends suspected that he had unleashed a malevolent force. Neil's fascination with the Ouija had opened a door to a dark world, one that he couldn't escape.",
